# 3. DESIGN DIRECTION

Selected design direction: BALANCED.

The website must look modern, elegant and spacious.

Avoid:
- Excessive visual noise.
- Overly dark backgrounds.
- Neon colors.
- Excessive gradients.
- Generic Bootstrap-style layouts.
- Too many rounded cards.
- Excessive glassmorphism.
- Constant movement everywhere.

Use:
- Warm neutral backgrounds.
- Muted natural accent colors.
- Large editorial typography.
- Generous whitespace.
- Asymmetric grids.
- Large photographs.
- Clear visual hierarchy.
- Carefully controlled motion.

